      "side": 1,
      "message": "my point here is that why even both looking at federation_constants.FEDERATION if we\u0027re not going to use it?\n\nshouldn\u0027t \"token_dict \u003d {\u0027user\u0027: token_ref[\u0027user\u0027]}\" happen regardless of whether or not the user is federated?",
